    "Easy Write %@ · Apple Intelligence": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write %@ · Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy Write Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write – Einstellungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy Write can’t read your selection yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write kann deine Auswahl noch nicht lesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy Write copies the text you select and pastes the result back. macOS asks you to allow that once, in Privacy & Security → Accessibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write liest den Text, den du auswählst, und setzt das Ergebnis wieder ein. macOS fragt dich einmal danach, unter Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Bedienungshilfen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy Write needs Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write braucht Bedienungshilfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy Write uses the language model built into macOS. It runs on this Mac, so nothing you write is uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write nutzt das Sprachmodell, das in macOS eingebaut ist. Es läuft auf diesem Mac, nichts von dem, was du schreibst, wird hochgeladen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy Write uses these exact words in every translation and action. Good for product names, job titles, and words you spell your own way, like E-Mail → Mail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Easy Write verwendet genau diese Wörter in jeder Übersetzung und Aktion. Praktisch für Produktnamen, Berufsbezeichnungen und Wörter, die du auf deine Art schreibst, etwa E-Mail → Mail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bearbeiten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exclude": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausschließen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explain in simple English how the grammar of this sentence works, including word order and any formal or informal forms. Use short bullet points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
